          "question": "Regarding the evaluation of system acceptability, I notice you conducted your survey immediately after a guided thirty-minute demonstration. Don't you think that evaluating usability and functional suitability under such controlled, guided conditions introduces significant observer bias and masks how the application would actually perform in the field without your supervision?"
        },
