          "question": "Regarding your data collection in Barangay Masagana, you had respondents capture three to five identifications on leaves available at the session. How did you ensure these leaves represented the full range of disease symptoms and varying field lighting conditions necessary to validate your model's performance beyond controlled, static environments?"
        },
